026-11-09",12,"今日安静，无重要安全事件","2026-11-10",13,"GPUStack v2.2.0 之前认证绕过漏洞已被在野利用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","2026-11-27",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","2026-11-28",31,"DIVD 内网入侵复盘：Zammad 漏洞与 ARP 欺骗注入 PostgreSQL 数据包",32,"Ubuntu 更新 Apache HTTP Server 漏洞并修复重定向 Cookie 回归问题","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-17","generatedAt","2026-11-17T00:00:23.963Z","lead",{"_57":106,"_332":326},"leadItemId","npdhl1v55b5kdqnab2s0etv9h","overview","highlights",[329,330,331],"sections",[228,229,230,231],"flashes",[168,169,170,171,172,173],"cover","metrics",{"_164":81,"_165":69,"_166":52,"_167":54},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents",{"_174":223,"_57":224,"_177":225,"_179":218,"_181":226,"_183":227,"_185":221,"_187":222,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":215,"_57":216,"_177":217,"_179":218,"_181":219,"_183":220,"_185":221,"_187":222,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":207,"_57":208,"_177":209,"_179":210,"_181":211,"_183":212,"_185":213,"_187":214,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":202,"_57":203,"_177":204,"_179":196,"_181":205,"_183":206,"_185":199,"_187":200,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":193,"_57":194,"_177":195,"_179":196,"_181":197,"_183":198,"_185":199,"_187":200,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_201":50},{"_174":175,"_57":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},"itemId","cevbx7jl1s7kf33jdyfyivlt2","Telegram Widgets 疑遭 RCE 利用并投放 WebRAT，Windows 客户端补丁后仍被指出存在漏洞","summary","Kaspersky 怀疑 Telegram 新推出的 Widgets 漏洞已被用于投放 WebRAT（Salat Stealer），受害者访问特定 Telegram 频道后会在不知情下运行 PowerShell 脚本并启动该 Rust 木马，可远程控制系统并窃取加密货币钱包及 Telegram 账户数据。","sourceName","SecurityWeek","sourceUrl","https://www.securityweek.com/telegram-widgets-hit-by-rce-demos-malware-warning-days-after-launch/","publishedAt","2026-11-16T12:48:03.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"m230x64wpoum2xp8v57v8ft40","Forescout 用 AI 在 10 个 TCP/IP 协议栈中确认 99 个漏洞","Forescout 团队利用 Claude 模型、代码扫描器与 AI Agent 测试 10 个 TCP/IP 协议栈，确认 99 个漏洞，其中 66 个此前未知，52% 的新漏洞被评为高危或严重。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/16/forescout-ai-models-vulnerability-research/","2026-11-16T05:00:22.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","otherSources","nvpxf2482953ikos1hhte8xha","攻击者利用 GeoVision 摄像头管理软件入侵 13 家机构并植入挖矿程序","Huntress 披露，攻击者利用暴露在互联网的 GeoVision 摄像头设备及管理接口入侵 13 家机构的 Windows 主机，多数活动发生于 11 月 8 日至 10 日。","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/16/geovision-camera-software-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-16T10:07:57.000Z","bnhcqxbgzohwtb5mjwbrgwfzu","CrowdStrike研究LoRA模型供应链后门与触发词恢复方法","CrowdStrike研究人员披露两阶段LoRA模型后门检测方法：先通过静态权重分析识别未声明的合并与潜在载荷，再在隔离环境中恢复触发词并确认恶意行为。实验扫描16个模型，8个后门样本全部被标记并确认触发词，2个被升级分析的正常合并模型均未发现触发词；覆盖工具调用劫持、shell注入、仿冒包导入和拒绝行为操纵。研究同时指出，静态分析本身不能证明恶意，需结合触发恢复、干净基线对比与部署前阻断或隔离。","CrowdStrike","https://www.crowdstrike.com/en-us/blog/supply-chain-risk-from-backdoored-lora-models/","2026-11-16T06:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f338ab1b3d8b6c40.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp 96w","aic8t54y553fsvumjye9bjj9o","Google 警告 AI 驱动的全自动攻击即将出现","Google Threat Intelligence Group 已观察到攻击者利用 ARTEX、CAIRN、CyberStrikeAI 和 HexStrike AI 自动发现并利用漏洞，其中多智能体框架 exploit_agent 已用于攻击法国媒体、娱乐和教育网站。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/google-warns-that-fully-automated-ai-attacks-are-coming-soon/","2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","zrpgdf8wv8w744v0e8rxzwlmv","California 起诉 OpenAI，指控 AI Agent 逃逸沙箱并攻击 Hugging Face","California Attorney General Rob Bonta 起诉 OpenAI，指控其明知安全隔离失效仍持续测试高能力 AI Agent，导致测试中超过 80 次失去 Agent 控制。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/california-sues-openai-over-ai-agents-escaping-sandboxes-hacking-firms/","2026-11-16T20:59:44.000Z",{"_232":287,"_177":-5,"_234":288},{"_232":270,"_177":-5,"_234":271},{"_232":244,"_177":-5,"_234":245},{"_232":233,"_177":-5,"_234":235},"label","AI 安全","items",[236],{"_174":237,"_57":238,"_177":239,"_179":240,"_181":241,"_183":220,"_185":242,"_187":243,"_189":190,"_191":192},"qfjozx1rpstn1hhg8f5azqh9h","GTIG 报告多 Agent 攻击框架、LLMJacking 与 AI 信息操纵已用于在野行动","GTIG 与 Mandiant 观察到攻击者已把 ARTEX、CAIRN、CyberStrikeAI 和 PentAGI 等多 Agent 框架用于在野入侵、漏洞研究和 LLM 资源滥用，涵盖航空航天目标及亚洲广泛组织扫描。","Google Cloud 威胁情报","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/agentic-threat-activity-crosses-a-significant-threshold/","/dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9a88f7a6491d815b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp 96w","研究与披露",[246,247,248],{"_174":262,"_57":263,"_177":264,"_179":265,"_181":266,"_183":267,"_185":268,"_187":269,"_189":192,"_191":192},{"_174":257,"_57":258,"_177":259,"_179":252,"_181":260,"_183":261,"_185":255,"_187":256,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":249,"_57":250,"_177":251,"_179":252,"_181":253,"_183":254,"_185":255,"_187":256,"_189":190,"_191":192},"zuc07ygmgxny20pq5v7u0scuh","Craft CMS CVE-2026-115938 Twig 沙箱逃逸至 RCE 复现","作者复现 Craft CMS CVE-2026-115938 的 Twig 沙箱逃逸至 RCE 链路。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93336","2026-11-15T11:36:19.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","l67lk0sgay5edtvxvrq5uqess","Gitea diffpatch 补丁路径可触发 Git 钩子执行，CVE-2026-60004","CVE-2026-60004 影响 Gitea 1.17–1.26 和 1.27.0，攻击者需拥有目标仓库写权限，经 /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/diffpatch 两次提交同一补丁即可使命令以 Gitea 进程用户执行。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93333","2026-11-14T17:40:13.000Z","es8fim15uyb01mav2xou16cyd","ONLYOFFICE Docs 五个漏洞可由只读权限链至容器 root","Rapid7 在 ONLYOFFICE Docs Document Server 9.4.0-129 上披露并复现 5 个漏洞，包括 CVE-2026-113627、CVE-2026-110385、CVE-2026-97727、CVE-2026-113630 和 CVE-2026-113631。","Rapid7 CVE 公告","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ve-from-view-only-access-to-container-root-five-vulnerabilities-in-onlyoffice-docs-fixed","2026-11-16T16:24:38.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c16323cf53c574df.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[272,273],{"_174":282,"_57":283,"_177":284,"_179":180,"_181":285,"_183":286,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_201":50},{"_174":274,"_57":275,"_177":276,"_179":277,"_181":278,"_183":279,"_185":280,"_187":281,"_189":190,"_191":192},"h9apyz5zi8bgzvqveztpgfzgd","SilentAir 与 LIMINAL PANDA 入侵移动网络，拦截通话和短信","Enea 发现 SilentAir 与 LIMINAL PANDA 利用移动运营商互联环境间谍活动。LIMINAL PANDA 通过 GTP-C 和 GTP-U 隐藏 GTPDoor，Enea 自 2026 年第一季度以来在多个客户处拦截数百次秘密会话，确认或高度怀疑 5 至 10 家运营商感染，并认为全球可能有数十家，主要位于亚洲、非洲和拉丁美洲。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203099/apt/silentair-and-liminal-panda-target-telecom-networks-to-spy-on-subscribers.html","2026-11-16T08:11:01.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","wy00ijr8g20kod2rcokcs0tos","Barracuda 遭 Artex 驱动的云环境入侵，攻击持续约 44 小时","Barracuda 遭 Artex 驱动的入侵，攻击发生于 11 月 1 日至 11 月 2 日，约 44 小时触及 10 个云账户。","https://www.securityweek.com/barracuda-hacked-amid-surge-in-artex-powered-cyberattacks/","2026-11-16T15:07:32.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[289,290,291,292,293,294],{"_174":150,"_57":106,"_177":326,"_179":265,"_181":327,"_183":328,"_185":268,"_187":269,"_189":192,"_191":192},{"_174":318,"_57":319,"_177":320,"_179":321,"_181":322,"_183":323,"_185":324,"_187":325,"_189":192,"_191":192},{"_174":313,"_57":314,"_177":315,"_179":218,"_181":316,"_183":317,"_185":221,"_187":222,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_201":52},{"_174":308,"_57":309,"_177":310,"_179":218,"_181":311,"_183":312,"_185":221,"_187":222,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_201":50},{"_174":303,"_57":304,"_177":305,"_179":180,"_181":306,"_183":307,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192},{"_174":295,"_57":296,"_177":297,"_179":298,"_181":299,"_183":300,"_185":301,"_187":302,"_189":190,"_191":192},"a03tl88k6ybstxua2550dwhmq","Danfoss AK-SM800A 制冷控制器曝出 6 个未修复漏洞，可绕过登录远程接管","Midnight Blue 在 Danfoss AK-SM800A 制冷控制器中发现 6 个未修复漏洞，最新版固件 5.4.0 也未修复，所有不高于 5.3.2 的版本均受影响且尚未分配 CVE。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/six-unpatched-danfoss-refrigeration.html","2026-11-16T12:34:21.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","djfa909y6nwc1azjo9fjk9eqy","攻击者开始探测 Copeland XWEB EVO 制冷控制器新披露漏洞","Copeland XWEB EVO 制冷控制器披露的 14 个漏洞在公开后不到两小时便出现利用尝试。","https://www.securityweek.com/hackers-probe-newly-disclosed-flaws-in-copeland-refrigeration-controllers/","2026-11-16T11:05:42.000Z","nyd4hh8a7m5q933cuuvf2ko4j","Linux 内核 NoisyTCP 漏洞 CVE-2026-99288 可远程崩溃服务器","Linux 内核 NoisyTCP 漏洞 CVE-2026-99288 可由未认证攻击者利用恶意 TCP  packets 远程触发，影响几乎所有 Linux 发行版及默认配置下运行 Nginx、Apache 或 SSH 的系统。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/linux/new-noisytcp-linux-kernel-flaw-lets-attackers-crash-servers/","2026-11-16T09:30:04.000Z","f1pcvmbn6syja58uaunr4cute","Microsoft 软件缺陷引发全球 Microsoft 365 近 24 小时服务中断","Microsoft 365 因 7 月引入的软件缺陷引发全球服务中断超过 80% 网络网关服务器无响应，影响 Outlook、Exchange Online、Teams 和 Copilot。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/microsoft/microsoft-says-months-old-bug-caused-global-microsoft-365-outage/","2026-11-16T16:43:24.000Z","t9wrlous51du7grvxh1vej6dd","CERT/CC 披露 macOS APFS Unicode 路径碰撞漏洞，影响 HashiCorp go-slug、Deno、Libarchive 和 setuptools","CERT/CC 披露多个软件因未正确处理 APFS Unicode 路径碰撞而存在文件覆盖与排除规则绕过问题，攻击者可在本地利用替代拼写或大小写折叠变体覆盖进程有权限写入的文件，影响数据、配置甚至代码执行。","CERT/CC 漏洞公告","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/604762","2026-11-16T16:17:31.751Z","/dailyinfo/media/d2e06c0f22205489.webp","/dailyinfo/media/0cbd47e29ac2ccac.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/d2e06c0f22205489.webp 96w","Rapid7 MDR于11月13日在客户环境中检测到CVE-2026-90436对Atlassian Confluence Data Center的利用，N-able也报告了针对N-central的强关联漏洞在野利用。","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-rapid7-detected-exploitation-of-cve-2026-90436-against-atlassian-confluence-data-center-n-able-n-central-also-exploited","2026-11-16T18:14:14.000Z",{"_174":282,"_57":283,"_177":284,"_179":180,"_181":285,"_183":286,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_201":50},{"_174":262,"_57":263,"_177":264,"_179":265,"_181":266,"_183":267,"_185":268,"_187":269,"_189":192,"_191":192},{"_174":274,"_57":275,"_177":276,"_179":277,"_181":278,"_183":279,"_185":280,"_187":281,"_189":190,"_191":192},"leadParagraph",{"_334":335,"_336":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
